      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Simple <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executor</code></a> based <a href=\"MessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>MessageListenerContainer</code></a> implementation for running <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>tasks</code></a> like\nlistening to MongoDB <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/changeStreams/\">Change Streams</a> and tailable\ncursors.",
      "translation": "简单的基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/Executor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>Executor</code></a>的<a href=\"MessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>MessageListenerContainer</code></a>实现，用于运行诸如监听 MongoDB <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/changeStreams/\">Change Streams</a>和尾随游标之类的<code>tasks</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is the link between the <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> and the actual running <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Task</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 是连接 <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> 与实际运行的 <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>Task</code></a> 的桥梁。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> implementation to be used for listening to\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/changeStreams/\">Change Streams</a> via a <a href=\"MessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>MessageListenerContainer</code></a>\nusing the synchronous MongoDB Java driver.",
      "translation": "用于通过同步 MongoDB Java 驱动程序的<a href=\"MessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>MessageListenerContainer</code></a>监听<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/changeStreams/\">Change Streams</a>的<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a>实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions</code></a> implementation specific to a <a href=\"ChangeStreamRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>ChangeStreamRequest</code></a>.",
      "translation": "专用于<a href=\"ChangeStreamRequest.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>ChangeStreamRequest</code></a>的<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions</code></a>实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The actual <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> sent to the <a href=\"MessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>MessageListenerContainer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实际发送到<a href=\"MessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>MessageListenerContainer</code></a>的<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> implementation to be used to listen to query results in a\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/core/capped-collections/\">Capped Collection</a> using a\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/core/tailable-cursors/\">Tailable Cursor</a>.",
      "translation": "用于监听 <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/core/capped-collections/\">Capped Collection（固定集合）</a> 中查询结果的 <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> 实现，该实现基于 <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/core/tailable-cursors/\">Tailable Cursor（可尾随游标）</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest.RequestOptions</code></a> implementation specific to a <a href=\"TailableCursorRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>TailableCursorRequest</code></a>.",
